  "changes": [
    "One normalized ordered pane descriptor list drives world upload eligibility, geometry observation and bundle encoding. Remove raw empty-descriptor board/companion world fallbacks. Empty layouts cannot resurrect board commands; missing schematic remains unadmitted, while zero quad count no longer suppresses possible stroke-only schematic geometry.",
    "Remove both unused fixed legacy camera uniforms from initialization, recovery, consumers and submission holds. Required fixed screen uniform and charged per-pane camera owners remain.",
    "Remove unused schematic immediate grid CPU/GPU storage and old board immediate underlay/grid construction. Ordered shared grid owner draws every admitted pane; existing panel backgrounds and empty-layout background fallback remain. Internal screen streams7 and consumer-incidence streams13; all14 logical consumers remain.",
    "Native Main/input projection/capture no longer run duplicate retained ensures before shared full preparation. Shared terminal damage lease precedes fallible source validation. Diagnostic preparation timing now names combined source/prepared work.",
    "Remove obsolete editor-facing history-key exports; renderer root physical size and include expansion shrink, exact expanded ceiling5975->5973. No cap increase."
  ],
  "verification_rationale": "Normalized descriptors must preserve all composition consumers and prevent fallback resurrection. Existing renderer contracts, affected fixed/pane uniform retirement and shared host admission, exact capture comparison, and native Main/dialog/capture control establish this unit before prefix copying.",
