    "terminal_boundary_mutation_controls": 7,
    "affected_all_target_visual_clippy": "pass",
    "source_health_parity_frontier_dependency": "pass"
  },
  "preserved_failures": [
    "New normalization negative initially used a fixture with no visible commands; changed to existing real board fixture, which also includes schematic. Updated its initial schematic expectation accordingly.",
    "Two old substrate assertions observed unused underlay vertices. Migrated unchanged substrate/no-decorative-edge requirements to the drawn pane panel stream and asserted composed underlay is absent; final414 pass.",
    "Host admission negative expected obsolete144-byte fixed uniform baseline. Actual16-byte baseline confirmed removal; reserve45 of remaining60 bytes so required16-byte replacement must refuse. Refusal/retirement and pixel control pass.",
    "Clippy found now-unused immediate grid emitters. Retained only cfg(test) comparison helpers for shared grid owner; production uses admitted visitor. Final affected Clippy passes."
  ],
